    <briefdescription>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_module_pass" kindref="compound">ModulePass</ref></computeroutput> which wraps up a <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_call_graph" kindref="compound">CallGraph</ref></computeroutput> and the logic to build it. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class exposes both the interface to the call graph container and the module pass which runs over a module of IR and produces the call graph. The call graph interface is entirelly a wrapper around a <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_call_graph" kindref="compound">CallGraph</ref></computeroutput> object which is stored internally for each module. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
